xiang:p001","start_codepoint":13,"end_codepoint":22,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang-ws1963381"},{"id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-22","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"人間垣内有小塚，墳上殆平，毎朝日初升，見一女子立塚上，近視則亡。","reading":"城垣小塚初升見女子，近視則亡，是傳聞敘事。","note":"城垣小塚初升見女子，近視則亡，是傳聞敘事。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":22,"end_codepoint":54,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang-ws1963381"},{"id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-54","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"或以告玄象，便命發之。","reading":"無名告事者報玄象，玄象命發之。","note":"無名告事者報玄象，玄象命發之。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":54,"end_codepoint":65,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang-ws1963381"},{"id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-65","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"有一棺尚全，有金蠶、銅人以百數。","reading":"金蠶、銅人以百數，是物數。","note":"金蠶、銅人以百數，是物數。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":65,"end_codepoint":81,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang-ws1963381"},{"id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-81","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"剖棺見一女子，年可二十，姿質若生，臥而言曰：「我東海王家女，應生，資財相奉，幸勿見害。」","reading":"棺中女子外貌可二十，自稱東海王家女，未具父名。","note":"棺中女子外貌可二十，自稱東海王家女，未具父名。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":81,"end_codepoint":125,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang-ws1963381"},{"id":"c-nanshi-016-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-125","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"女臂有玉釧，破塚者斬臂取之，於是女復死。","readi