ource_quote":"好發冢，地無完椁。","reading":"敘玄象好發冢。","note":"敘玄象好發冢。","paragraph_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":20,"end_codepoint":29,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang-ws2587864"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-29","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"時人間垣內有小冢，墳上殆平。","reading":"墳在垣內。","note":"墳在垣內。","paragraph_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":29,"end_codepoint":43,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang-ws2587864"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-43","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"每朝日初升，見一女子立冢上，近視則亡。","reading":"晨見女子，近視則亡。","note":"晨見女子，近視則亡。","paragraph_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":43,"end_codepoint":62,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang-ws2587864"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-62","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"或以告玄象，便命發之。","reading":"玄象得無名告事者說，遂令發之。","note":"玄象得無名告事者說，遂令發之。","paragraph_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":62,"end_codepoint":73,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang-ws2587864"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-73","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"有一棺尚全，有金蠶銅人以百數。","reading":"金蠶銅人以百數。","note":"金蠶銅人以百數。","paragraph_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":73,"end_codepoint":88,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang-ws2587864"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-88","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"剖棺，見一女子，可二十，姿質若生，臥而言曰：「我東海王家女，應生。","reading":"女子看似約二十，自陳東海王家女。","note":"女子看似約二十，自陳東海王家女。","paragraph_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":88,"end_codepoint":121,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang-ws2587864"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-121","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"資財相奉，幸勿見害。」","reading":"續其求免之詞。","note":"續其求免之詞。","paragraph_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":121,"end_codepoint":132,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang-ws2587864"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:received_sentence1-132","kind":"received_sentence","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"女臂有玉釧，斬臂取之，于是女復死。","reading":"引文止女復死，無王玄謨上聞及玄象免郡。","note":"引文止女復死，無王玄謨上聞及玄象免郡。","paragraph_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":132,"end_codepoint":149,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang-ws2587864"},{"id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:quoted_book1-0","kind":"quoted_book","person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","source_quote":"《宋書》曰","reading":"類書於冢墓二署《宋書》，今本宋書卷76沒有王玄象此附敘。引文所見不可當作今本沈約單卷正文。","note":"類書於冢墓二署《宋書》，今本宋書卷76沒有王玄象此附敘。引文所見不可當作今本沈約單卷正文。","paragraph_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang:p001","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":5,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang","source_id":"s-taipingyulan-558-wangxuanxiang-ws2587864"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-xuanmo-nan-xiang-congdi","subject_person_id":"94x_2iu_gsm","object_person_id":"31b_fd1_f77","predicate":"agnatic_cousin","qualifiers":{"source_term":"玄謨從弟玄象","kinship_structure":{"lineage":"paternal","generation_diff